allocates ~25 GiB and OOMs — the same reason biobb_wf_cmip's python CI test is
disabled (docs/ci.md, "Still open" #1).

This file opts biobb_wf_cmip out of the publish chain's docker e2e gate
(publish-ghcr.yaml, select job): the image still publishes on template changes
(common/docker/**), untested, like every other workflow without a docker e2e.
Delete this file to re-enable the gate (once the e2e runs on a bigger runner or a
reduced run is found).
